## GHL OAuth Setup

### 1. Create GHL App

1. Go to https://marketplace.gohighlevel.com/
2. Click "Create App"
3. Fill in app details:
   - Name: Your app name
   - Description: GHL Onboarding automation
   - App URL: Your production URL
4. Configure OAuth:
   - Redirect URI: `https://yourapp.com/api/auth/ghl/callback`
   - Scopes: Select all needed scopes
5. Save and get:
   - Client ID → `NEXT_PUBLIC_GHL_CLIENT_ID`
   - Client Secret → `GHL_CLIENT_SECRET`

