## Post-Deployment Testing

### 1. Health Check

```bash
curl https://yourapp.com/api/health
```

Expected response:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "status": "healthy",
    "services": {
      "database": { "status": "up" },
      "storage": { "status": "up" }
    }
  }
}
```

### 2. Test Authentication Flow

1. Sign up a test user
2. Get JWT token
3. Test authenticated endpoint:

```bash
curl https://yourapp.com/api/user/me \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN"
```

### 3. Test GHL OAuth

1. Visit: `https://yourapp.com/api/auth/ghl/authorize`
2. Complete OAuth flow
3. Check connection status:

```bash
curl https://yourapp.com/api/auth/ghl/status \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN"
```

### 4. Test Form Submission

```bash
curl -X POST https://yourapp.com/api/form/submit \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "stage_number": 1,
    "stage_data": {
      "businessName": "Test Company",
      "industry": "hvac"
    }
  }'
```

