## Rollback Procedure

If deployment fails or has critical bugs:

### 1. Instant Rollback (Vercel)

1. Go to Vercel Dashboard > Deployments
2. Find last working deployment
3. Click "Promote to Production"

### 2. Database Rollback

```sql
-- If you need to revert schema changes
-- Create backup first!
pg_dump > backup.sql

-- Revert changes
-- (Manual SQL or migration tool)
```

### 3. Re-deploy Previous Version

```bash
git revert HEAD
git push origin main
```

